### ==========================================================================
### Coleção de requisições — API de Consulta de Saldo
### Compatível com IntelliJ IDEA / VSCode (REST Client) e exportável para Postman.
### ==========================================================================

### 1. Consulta de saldo (200 OK)
# Substitua pelo UUID de uma conta existente (ex.: extraído do SQS)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/balances/5b19c8b6-0cc4-4c72-a989-0c2ee15fa975
Accept: application/json

### 2. Conta inexistente (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/balances/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### 3. UUID inválido (400)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/balances/nao-e-um-uuid
Accept: application/json

### 4. Health check (200 — "UP")
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### 5. Métricas Prometheus
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/prometheus
Accept: text/plain

### 6. Documentação OpenAPI (JSON)
GET http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs
Accept: application/json

### 7. Swagger UI
GET http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html

### 8. Health check do ingestor
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### 9. Inspecionar mensagens da fila SQS (Localstack) via AWS CLI
# aws --endpoint-url http://localhost:4566 --region sa-east-1 sqs receive-message \
#     --queue-url http://localhost:4566/000000000000/transacoes-financeiras-processadas \
#     --max-number-of-messages 10
